#: usr/share/fish-tweak-tool/ftt_gui.py:1311
msgid ""
"500+ palettes from tinted-theming. Applying one recolours your terminal's 16-"
"colour ANSI palette and background — affecting everything in the terminal "
"(ls, git, vim …) — and re-applies in every new shell. It's a separate layer "
"on top of the fish syntax theme on the Themes tab."
